cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: >-
  ZIDR Benchmark: Adversarial Robustness Evaluation for Women's Safety AI
  (Scenario Library, Probe Tool, and Benchmark Runner)
abstract: >-
  The ZIDR benchmark operationalises Zero-Interaction Detection Rate (ZIDR),
  a metric for passive-detection robustness under adversary-induced sensing
  degradation. It comprises a 14-scenario adversarial library grounded in
  Indian deployment context, four reference system profiles, a ZIDR scoring
  engine, and a governance gap checker covering five regulatory frameworks.
